message: "Please cite this dataset using the metadata below and the version-specific DOI when available."
title: "Chapter 5 Data and Reproducibility Archive: Fragmentation, Coordination and Functional Differentiation in Global Ocean Economy Governance"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Adewumi"
    given-names: "Ibukun"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-08-02
abstract: >-
  Public data and reproducibility archive for the comparative analysis of
  institutional incongruence, relational coordination, and functional
  differentiation across 48 intergovernmental organisations involved in
  global ocean economy governance. The archive contains analysis-ready
  datasets, public-safe normalised input matrices, R scripts, figures,
  methodological documentation, and quality-assurance records.
keywords:
  - global ocean governance
  - ocean economy
  - intergovernmental organisations
  - institutional fragmentation
  - relational coordination
  - functional differentiation
  - organisational ecology
  - reproducible research
